# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  AgenticQA — what stays out of the repository
#
#  Rule of thumb: a file belongs here if it is generated, machine-specific,
#  secret, or written for an audience that is not a contributor.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env.example IS committed and must only ever hold placeholders.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*

# ── Dependencies & build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
out/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.vsix
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
.npm
.eslintcache
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .vscode/launch.json and tasks.json ARE committed: they are what makes F5
# ("Run Extension") work, which is the first instruction in CONTRIBUTING.md.
# Everything else under .vscode/ is personal.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# ── AI-agent tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Instructions written for coding agents, not for people. The technical content
# they carried lives in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and CONTRIBUTING.md instead.
.claude/
.qwen/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# ── Internal planning & coursework ───────────────────────────────────────────
IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md
doc/
finalrefdoc/
final ref doc/

# ── Test & run artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
playwright/.cache/
agenticqa-reports/
**/agenticqa-reports/
debug-screenshot.png
*.zip

# Generated specs are ephemeral by design — AgenticQA rewrites them on demand.
tests/generated/
apps/**/tests/generated/
packages/**/tests/generated/

# Self-heal capture temp artifacts (normally auto-deleted)
**/__agenticqa_heal_*

# ── Knowledge-pack churn ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Packs themselves ARE committed; their timestamped backups and evidence dumps
# are not.
**/.agenticqa/knowledge.backup-*.json
**/.agenticqa/*.evidence
**/.agenticqa/knowledge.generated-*.json

# ── Benchmark output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
batch-results-*.json
batch-template-run-results.json
batch-artifacts/
packages/**/batch-results-*.json
packages/**/batch-artifacts/

# ── Caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
packages/**/.cache/
.playwright-mcp/

# ── Scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tmp/
temp_headings.*
rerun*.txt
lastoutput.txt
lastprompt.txt
TerminalOutput.md
*.log
*.local
*.volume
